8
00:00:12,617 --> 00:00:15,403
Alasannya, supaya programmer mereka tidak dibajak pesaing.

9
00:00:15,914 --> 00:00:17,322
Gajinya sekitar dua puluh dua ribu dolar

10
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:18,422
